ALCHEMIST-CITRINITAS.description:
Deal damage to ALL enemies equal to your [gold]Regen[/gold].{FormulaDamage}
[gold]Reaction[/gold] (Exhaust): Hits again.
Add a {IfUpgraded:show:[green]Rubedo+[/green]|[gold]Rubedo[/gold]} into your [gold]Hand[/gold].

ALCHEMIST-FROTH.description:
[gold]Ferment{FermentSuffix}.[/gold]
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
Hits an additional time for each turn fermented.{HitsLine}

ALCHEMIST-GOLDEN_TOUCH.description:
[gold]Enchanted[/gold] cards cost 1 less.
If this card is [gold]Enchanted[/gold], it costs {energyPrefix:energyIcons(1)} less.{IfUpgraded:show:
[green]Infuse a card in your Hand.[/green]|}

ALCHEMIST-LASH_OUT.description:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage 3 times.
[gold]Gambit[/gold]: Gain 1 [gold]Regen[/gold] for each hit.
[gold]Reaction[/gold] (Power): Hits an additional time.{HitsLine}

ALCHEMIST-SWEAT_IT_OUT.description:
[gold]Ferment{FermentSuffix}.[/gold]
Gain {SelfPoison:diff()} [gold]Poison[/gold], plus {FermentPoison} for each turn fermented.
Lose all [gold]Poison[/gold]. Apply that much [gold]Poison[/gold] to ALL enemies.{ApplyLine}
